# Proposals on real repo tasks: the model guesses, asteroid decides. Nothing here is a claim or a record.
# See asteroid/SPEC.md, "Proposals: the model guesses, asteroid decides", and language/BASE.md.
seq catalan = from brain/neuron/fingerprints.json "Catalan"
seq segmental = from brain/neuron/fingerprints.json "segmental-growth"
kripke all3 = all 3 any
propose cat "a closed formula for the sequence catalan, 1, 1, 2, 5, 14, 42, 132 (term i is at n = i)" model 1.5B n 3
propose seg "a closed formula for the sequence segmental, 1, 1, 3, 15, 105, 945 (term i is at n = i)" model 1.5B n 3
propose sym "a modal formula valid exactly on symmetric frames, written as claim defines all3 FORMULA symmetric" model 1.5B n 3
